  ('#2', 'Kofee', '2413 Third Ave, Bronx, NY 10451', 'Bronx', '10451', 40.812775, -73.935067, 'Visit Completed', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'Koffee (Brooklyn) is an amazing local small business featuring strong, tasty drinks and great food in a work-friendly atmosphere. It offers a cozy, highly welcoming environment with varied seating, including front booth options. The Brooklyn location charms with its intimate setup, while its sister spot in the Bronx offers even more room to settle in.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Some', FALSE, 'NO', 'Sayraliz'),
  ('#3', 'The Clubhouse Cafe', '812 River Ave, Bronx, NY 10451', 'Bronx', '10451', 40.82637, -73.926727, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'The Clubhouse Cafe is a family-friendly spot that features beautiful decor, relaxed vibes, and full-bodied coffee paired with pastries from Mottley Kitchen. It offers a quiet, safe environment to focus on work or catch up with friends while watching sports or listening to chill music. All proceeds directly support youth programs through the South Bronx United nonprofit.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#4', 'Mottley Kitchen', '402 E 140th St, Bronx, NY 10454', 'Bronx', '10454', 40.81014, -73.921707, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Mottley Kitchen is a cozy local cafe and restaurant located in the South Bronx featuring exposed white brick and warm wooden accents. It serves a delicious variety of coffee, pastries, and healthy breakfast and lunch options including vegetarian and vegan choices. It also boasts a wonderful outdoor rooftop space with neighborhood views.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#5', 'Prince Coffee House', '2306 Arthur Ave, Bronx, NY 10458', 'Bronx', '10458', 40.85305, -73.897017, 'Visit Completed', 'Iris', 'markers.csv', 'Avenue Coffee House features a unique layout with a window-front view that transitions into a cement-based back area, accented by wood seating and background music for a cozy vibe. Flooded with tons of natural sunlight, it offers both wall and hand-held menus to browse. It is a fantastic destination known for its great coffee drinks and impressive food menu.', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#6', 'KYAN Cafe', '685 Morris Park Ave, Bronx, NY 10462', 'Bronx', '10462', 40.848212, -73.875467, 'Visit Completed', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'WiFi (ask for it), fair amount of seating but crowded but no outlet or restroom', TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#7', 'Artizen Cafe', '3700 Riverdale Ave, Bronx, NY 10463', 'Bronx', '10463', 40.88679, -73.90709, 'Visit Completed', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'Artizen Cafe combines creative energy with a comfortable workspace environment, making it a favorite for local freelancers and remote workers. The interior features artistic touches and plenty of cozy spots to settle in with a laptop. Alongside smooth specialty coffee, they offer a rotating selection of fresh pastries and light bites.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', TRUE, 'First 2 hours free, day pass avaliable', 'Orlando'),
  ('#8', 'Mon Amour Coffee & Wine', '234 W 238th St, Bronx, NY 10463', 'Bronx', '10463', 40.88486, -73.900291, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Mon Amour Cafe is a hidden gem in the upper Bronx with a welcoming community and space, cozy but homey with great food, drinks and hospitality. Happy hour later in the evening, great for productive work days and an unwinding after all in the same spot.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#9', 'Savor Coffee and More', '3725 Riverdale Ave, Bronx, NY 10463', 'Bronx', '10463', 40.88746, -73.90722, 'Incomplete', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'Savor Coffee and More is a welcoming neighborhood haven known for its comforting atmosphere and reliable productivity space. It features a great selection of classic coffee drinks, teas, and delicious baked goods to fuel a long work session. The friendly service and cozy seating make it a go-to local spot for getting things done.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', TRUE, 'Only permitted to stay with purchase', 'Orlando'),
  ('#10', 'Nefer Bookcafe', '694 E 241st St, Bronx, NY 10470', 'Bronx', '10470', 40.9008, -73.87365, 'Incomplete', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'Nefer Bookcafe is a peaceful and unique cultural sanctuary that blends the love of literature with a cozy coffeehouse experience. Surrounded by curated bookshelves, it provides a quiet atmosphere ideal for reading, focused work, or intimate conversation. It offers a warm selection of hot drinks and light bites in a uniquely intellectual setting.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Orlando'),
  ('#11', 'The Way Cafe', '1015 Castle Hill Ave, Bronx, NY 10472', 'Bronx', '10472', 40.831437, -73.8763, 'Incomplete', 'Iris', 'markers.csv', 'Great cafe with coffee, different drinks other than coffee and hot food', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#12', 'The Boogie Down Grind', '868 Hunts Point Ave, Bronx, NY 10474', 'Bronx', '10474', 40.81854, -73.888895, 'Visit Completed', 'Orlando', 'markers.csv', 'The Boogie Down Grind is a hip-hop culture-themed oasis in the South Bronx that brings the community together through art, music, and great drinks. Locally owned and operated, it serves a fantastic mix of espresso drinks, baked goods, and savory sandwiches. It also features award-winning outdoor seating alongside its vibrant indoor lounge space.', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#13', 'Fontainhas', '28 Jay St, Brooklyn, NY 11201', 'Brooklyn', '11201', 40.690288, -73.99755, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Sweet and welcoming employees, kind about laptops restrictions must be at the bar especially when it gets busy, interesting backstory, emphasises connection with each other as humans, stays open late until 10/10:30, great food and coffee', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'Designated laptop spots', 'Denisse'),
  ('#14', 'Swallow Cafe', '156 Atlantic Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11201', 'Brooklyn', '11201', 40.6782, -73.9442, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Swallow Cafe is a cozy cafe with a small upstairs area overlooking the cafe inside, hidden gem in Brooklyn known for it''s often quiet atmosphere, more social on the weekends but overall a great place to visit with a rustic aesthetic to get work done, good food and wifi, note laptop designated areas.', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', TRUE, 'Designated laptop spots', 'Denisse'),
  ('#15', 'Brooklyn Kolache Co', '520 DeKalb Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11205', 'Brooklyn', '11205', 40.696463, -73.9742, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Brooklyn Kolache brings a unique twist to the local cafe scene by pairing specialty coffee with traditional, freshly baked sweet and savory Czech kolaches. The warm, inviting space features cozy seating areas that are great for settling in with a laptop or a book. It offers a deliciously distinct flavor experience alongside a friendly neighborhood ambiance.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#16', 'High & Dry Coffee Bar', '899 Broadway, Brooklyn, NY 11206', 'Brooklyn', '11206', 40.699262, -73.948933, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'High & Dry Coffee Bar is a sleek, no-fuss destination centered entirely around top-tier brewing craftsmanship. The minimalist aesthetic keeps distractions low, making it a peaceful environment to lock in and get deep work done. Known for its expertly crafted espresso and clean layout, it''s a hidden gem for productivity purists.', TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Some', TRUE, 'As long as purchases continue every few hours.', 'Denisse'),
  ('#17', 'The Concrete Jungle', '13 Jefferson St, Brooklyn, NY 11206', 'Brooklyn', '11206', 40.70425, -73.949067, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'The Concrete Jungle embraces its iconic city namesake with an urban-chic interior and an energetic neighborhood vibe. It serves up robust coffee selections and satisfying bites in a space designed for modern creatives and remote professionals. The lively environment provides a great backdrop for hustle and socialization alike.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#18', 'BKLYN BLEND', '601 Livonia Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11207', 'Brooklyn', '11207', 40.679462, -73.909883, 'Visit Completed', 'Troy (Outsider)', 'markers.csv', 'Described to be cozy and inviting, community oriented, known to be a cozy space but has great holistic food/drink options and everything you''d need to get work done, hidden gem for a quick hideaway, not too much walking room but more of a cozier smaller vibe.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Troy (Outsider)'),
  ('#19', 'Covert BK', '3 Covert St, Brooklyn, NY 11207', 'Brooklyn', '11207', 40.679725, -73.909483, 'Incomplete', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Covert BK features a friendly, bubbly community with high energy and good vibes for productivity, alongside its fair share of quieter days as a true hidden gem. It is a fantastic neighborhood spot that is particularly well-known for its exceptionally delicious pork, egg, and cheese sandwich, which makes the trip entirely worth it.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#20', 'As you like', '428 Humboldt St, Brooklyn, NY 11211', 'Brooklyn', '11211', 40.71325, -73.962033, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'WPA2-Personal key confirmed, more hidden cozy and lowkey cafe but features awesome ceramics and merch, fun drink options and yummy onigiris/japanese egg sandwich. Primary seating is a big table and two corners for seating, best for getting work done for a short amount of time to avoid overcrowding but great for getting work done when not busy, very calm and friendly vibes. Even hosts workshops you can find more info on, online. Fair amount of outlets throughout seating. Only downfall is no restroom, otherwise fun chill sppace.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 'Few', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#21', 'Here Bk', '26 Bushwick Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11211', 'Brooklyn', '11211', 40.709713, -73.96165, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Here Bk is a laid-back, modern cafe and bar that features a quiet corner atmosphere, good natural sunlight, and primarily booth seating with window-close outlets. Known for hosting local events and supporting entrepreneurs with community flyers, it offers common pastries and premade sandwiches alongside its own custom merch. It is an ideal spot to transition from a focused workday into a relaxing alcoholic drink to wind down.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Ample', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
  ('#22', 'Lakou Cafe', '195 Utica Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11213', 'Brooklyn', '11213', 40.675463, -73.941917, 'Visit Completed', 'Christopher', 'markers.csv', 'Lakou Cafe is a culture-deep Brooklyn spot that blends Haitian heritage with modern vibes, offering smooth coffee, smoothies, and delicious food. Founded by Cassandre Davilmar, it serves as a healthy-minded community space with great seating and outlets that transitions into chill vibes after work hours. It proudly stands as a Black-owned, women-owned, and Latino-owned neighborhood gem.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', TRUE, 'Buy additional items if staying 1hr+', 'Christopher'),
  ('#23', 'Postmark Cafe', '326 6th St, Brooklyn, NY 11215', 'Brooklyn', '11215', 40.658288, -73.9923, 'Visit Completed', 'Sayraliz', 'markers.csv', 'Postmark Cafe is a beloved, community-driven small business featuring an active community board and a small outdoor box for food donations. It offers both indoor and outdoor seating options alongside basic drinks and pastries, complete with charming pink accents and signature pink lids. With a kid-friendly space, it serves as a warm and welcoming local neighborhood hub.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Sayraliz'),
