  ('#28', 'Cup Of Brooklyn', '1071 Gates Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11221', 'Brooklyn', '11221', 40.697875, -73.931267, 'Assigned', 'Denisse', 'markers.csv', 'Cup Of Brooklyn is a cozy, tiny cafe that offers great welcoming vibes and a well-lit, rustic clean wood aesthetic. It features fresh bagels, delicious pastries, and standout drinks like their Nutella latte. It provides a charming and comfortable setting that is ideal for either getting some focused work done or socializing with others.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 'Many', FALSE, 'NO', 'Denisse'),
