  ('#33', 'Burly Coffee', '847 Atlantic Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11238', 'Brooklyn', '11238', 40.6759, -73.97665, 'Visit Completed', 'Sayraliz', 'markers.csv', 'Burly Coffee is a small, minimalist neighborhood spot with cute basic decor and a relaxed environment that is famously dog-friendly. It serves up tasty breakfast tacos alongside delicious coffee. Visitors can also enjoy a fun touch with their signature cute crossword puzzles.', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 'Some', TRUE, 'Purchase for every 90 mins', 'Sayraliz'),
